office_oxide 0.1.13: MIT OR Apache-2.0 (locally modified)
https://github.com/yfedoseev/office_oxide
Changes preserve explicit XLS column widths and row heights (including blank
rows), cell types, and number formats through OOXML conversion; recover DOC
pictures stored in WordDocument and validate image-record scanning; preserve
explicit DOC page breaks; pair automatic DOC footnote/endnote references with
their bodies and write automatic note-body marks in DOCX; classify DOC comments
correctly; avoid inferred headings for structured DOC paragraphs; preserve natural
PNG proportions for fallback legacy images; and avoid invented PPT slide titles.

